  "rules": [
    "Do not delete a Portuguese root before file-level classification.",
    "Do not copy content merely to create bilingual symmetry.",
    "Do not assign artifact identity from physical path alone.",
    "Do not assign artifact_id or concept_id before sufficient content-level evidence exists.",
    "Do not mark a family consolidated until references and tests pass.",
    "Preserve historical provenance for migrated artifacts.",
    "Treat CONTENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED and AUDIT_REQUIRED as non-consolidated states.",
    "Keep the existing SourceResolver as runtime authority.",
    "Do not treat this registry as proof that physical migration has occurred."
